{"title":"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 14","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2_(Half_Angle_Formulas)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2 (Half Angle Formulas)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3_(Double_Angle_Formulas)\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3 (Double Angle Formulas)</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/e/a/fea4fc4e83db8990fba95df8b34d83b3777631f7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot 10+\\tan 5=$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"124\" height=\"14\" />\n</p><p><br />\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/1/4/014bec82a62dcaa0ba89f9896a8b97fd5f00d825.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A) \\csc 5 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(B) \\csc 10 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(C) \\sec 5 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(D) \\sec 10 } \\qquad \\mathrm{(E) \\sin 15 }$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"487\" height=\"18\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/3/4e3af05cd25ceb4e02857c0cf02076de102e09ce.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot 10 +\\tan 5=\\frac{\\cos 10}{\\sin 10}+\\frac{\\sin 5}{\\cos 5}=\\frac{\\cos10\\cos5+\\sin10\\sin5}{\\sin10\\cos 5}=\\frac{\\cos(10-5)}{\\sin10\\cos5}=\\frac{\\cos5}{\\sin10\\cos5}=\\boxed{\\textbf{(B)}\\csc 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"800\" height=\"40\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_2_.28Half_Angle_Formulas.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2_(Half_Angle_Formulas)\">Solution 2 (Half Angle Formulas)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2 (Half Angle Formulas)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/4/7e46c256be214b5e93638f59bf583c68eba46c5f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot 10 + \\tan 5 = \\frac{\\cos 10}{\\sin 10} + \\frac{1 - \\cos 10}{\\sin 10} = \\frac{1}{\\sin 10} = \\boxed{(\\textbf{B})\\csc 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"467\" height=\"38\" />.\n</p><p>-j4andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span id=\"Solution_3_.28Double_Angle_Formulas.29\"></span><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3_(Double_Angle_Formulas)\">Solution 3 (Double Angle Formulas)</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3 (Double Angle Formulas)\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/e/b6e1841caadf39d3c112dcc652e302bb86f183dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\cot 10 + \\tan 5 = \\frac{1}{\\tan 10} + \\tan 5 = \\frac{1}{\\frac{2 \\tan 5}{1 - \\tan^2 5}} + \\tan 5 = \\frac{1 - \\tan^2 5}{2 \\tan 5} + \\tan 5 = \\frac{1 - \\tan^2 5}{2 \\tan 5} + \\frac{2 \\tan^2 5}{2 \\tan 5}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -21px\" width=\"744\" height=\"49\" />\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/2/d/92dec17963d26a6d6499794b99e4a927e8e97523.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$= \\frac{1 + \\tan^2 5}{2 \\tan 5} = \\frac{\\sec^2 5}{2 \\tan 5} = \\frac{1}{2} \\sec^2 5 \\cot 5 = \\frac{1}{2} \\cdot \\frac{1}{\\cos^2 5} \\cdot \\frac {\\cos 5}{\\sin 5} = \\frac{1}{2 \\sin 5 \\cos 5} = \\frac{1}{\\sin 10} = \\boxed{(\\textbf{B})\\csc 10}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -13px\" width=\"752\" height=\"41\" />.\n</p><p>-j314andrews\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_14&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME\" title=\"1989 AHSME\">1989 AHSME</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1989 AHSME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=44&amp;year=1989\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 13\">Problem 13</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 15\">Problem 15</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_3\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 3\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1989_AHSME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1989 AHSME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b>